{
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:0": "嗯～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:1": "青蛙君～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:2": "怎麼好像怪怪的～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:3": "那、那條尾巴是怎麼了～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:4": "啊！\n那是前陣子撿到的護身符～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:5": "你怎麼了？要去哪裡～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/01 Intro/Japanese.txt:6": "我們一直以來\n都在一起的說～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/02 Looking for Froggy/Japanese.txt:0": "嗯～。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/02 Looking for Froggy/Japanese.txt:1": "青蛙君好像是\n往這邊來了～。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/02 Looking for Froggy/Japanese.txt:2": "到底跑到哪裡去了呢～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/03 Into the sewers/Japanese.txt:0": "青蛙君～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/03 Into the sewers/Japanese.txt:1": "嗯～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/03 Into the sewers/Japanese.txt:2": "鑽到車子底下去了～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/04 Tails has Froggy/Japanese.txt:0": "Ｗｏｗ！找到青蛙君了～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/04 Tails has Froggy/Japanese.txt:2": "嗯嘎！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/04 Tails has Froggy/Japanese.txt:3": "嘻～～～。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/04 Tails has Froggy/Japanese.txt:4": "哇啊！？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/04 Tails has Froggy/Japanese.txt:5": "啊啊啊啊，又跑掉了～。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:0": "咦～～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:1": "啊啊！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:2": "等、等一下啦～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/05 After Emerald Coast/Japanese.txt:3": "把我的朋友還給我啦～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/06 Before Hot Shelter/Japanese.txt:0": "咦～～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/06 Before Hot Shelter/Japanese.txt:1": "追著青蛙君跑，\n結果跑到奇怪的地方來了～。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/06 Before Hot Shelter/Japanese.txt:2": "有青蛙君的味道……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/06 Before Hot Shelter/Japanese.txt:3": "青蛙君一定\n在那扇門裡面！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/07 Found Froggy/Japanese.txt:0": "啊，青蛙君！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/07 Found Froggy/Japanese.txt:1": "得想辦法救牠才行！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/08 After Hot Shelter/Japanese.txt:0": "太好了～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/08 After Hot Shelter/Japanese.txt:1": "不可以再亂跑了喔～，\n青蛙君！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/08 After Hot Shelter/Japanese.txt:3": "什麼～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/09 Tikal Flashback (1)/Japanese.txt:0": "咦～～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/09 Tikal Flashback (1)/Japanese.txt:1": "這裡是～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:0": "好厲害……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:1": "可以嗎？\n讓我進來這種地方……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:10": "這就是\n統御七個混沌的翡翠……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:2": "你願意相信我嗎……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:3": "這就是七顆翡翠……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:6": "「行使者\n其為七個混沌」",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:7": "「抑制者\n其為統御混沌之人」",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:8": "七個混沌……",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/10 Tikal Flashback (2)/Japanese.txt:9": "統御它們的東西……？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/11 We better get going, buddy!/Japanese.txt:0": "咦～～？\n回來了嗎～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/11 We better get going, buddy!/Japanese.txt:1": "好像有點危險的樣子耶～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/11 We better get going, buddy!/Japanese.txt:2": "好不容易才救出青蛙君，\n要是沒辦法平安出去就沒意義了～。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/11 We better get going, buddy!/Japanese.txt:3": "得、得快逃才行～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:0": "哎呀，竟然逃出來了！\n不過，來得正好！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "卡歐斯！就是那個！\n把那隻青蛙弄到手！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:10": "成功了！\n很好！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:11": "青、青蛙君～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:12": "得、得去救青蛙君才行～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:14": "好！我來擋住那傢伙的行動，\n你趁這個時候想想辦法！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:15": "好～！\n青蛙君，我現在就來救你～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "連同混沌翡翠一起！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "很好！\n好，接下來是青蛙！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "那傢伙身上\n有你失去的尾巴！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:5": "只要把牠吸收掉，\n你就能取回完整的身體了！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:6": "來遲了嗎……！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:7": "卡歐斯……這就是那個卡歐斯嗎？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:8": "什麼？什麼～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/13 Before Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:9": "哇──哈哈哈！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/14 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:1": "好～。\n嘿嘿，再也不放開你了～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/14 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:2": "好！\n接下來交給我，你們快逃吧！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/14 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:3": "嗯、嗯。謝謝你～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/14 After Chaos 6 Fight/Japanese.txt:4": "來，青蛙君，\n我們快離開這裡吧～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/15 Hey, maybe we could use this/Japanese.txt:0": "嗯～？這個能用嗎～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/15 Hey, maybe we could use this/Japanese.txt:1": "雖然我不知道怎麼開～？",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/15 Hey, maybe we could use this/Japanese.txt:2": "算了，管他的～！",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/16 It's the Power Rod/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「強力釣竿」。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/16 It's the Power Rod/Japanese.txt:1": "拋竿的距離\n會大幅增加喔。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/17 You've discovered the Life Belt/Japanese.txt:0": "這是「救生圈」。\n進到水裡就能輕飄飄地浮起來。",
 "Misc/Cutscene Text/Big/17 You've discovered the Life Belt/Japanese.txt:1": "在水面上按下跳躍鈕，\n應該也能潛到水中游泳喔。"
}